meta {
  name: Delete Campaign Type
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/campaign-types/{{campaignTypeId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Cookie: auth_token={{authToken}}
}

docs {
  Soft delete, and refused (409) while any lead, campaign or assignment weight
  still points at the type -- the FKs are ON DELETE RESTRICT but a soft delete
  does not trip them. The tenant's is_default type can never be deleted (400).
}
